It runs the Haas speech recognition models through Haas-ASR
(https://github.com/third-intelligence/Haas-ASR, Apache License 2.0), which is installed as a
dependency and not redistributed here.

src/haas_asr_cpu/kda.py re-implements the Kimi Delta Attention layer of flash-linear-attention
(https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention), version 0.5.2, following its reference
implementations. flash-linear-attention is distributed under the following license:

